<h2>Vue</h2>
<p><code>.ce.vue</code> files are wrapped with the plugin's own <code>defineCustomElement</code>. Props become attributes, <code>&lt;slot&gt;</code> works as usual. See <a href="{{ path('uebertool_docs_pages.page', { slug: 'vue-custom-elements' }) }}">Vue custom elements</a> for styling.</p>
